    "BrochureContent": [
      {
        "ContentType": "Description",
        "SortOrder": 0,
        "Content": "Noel Kelly Auctioneers are delighted to present 71 Drynam Avenue a charming 2-bedroom semi-detached property which boasts well-proportioned accommodation throughout and is presented in turnkey condition. This wonderful property briefly comprises of an entrance hall, guest WC, a large open plan lounge into a fully fitted kitchen with dining room and utility room with double doors leading out to a landscaped rear garden. On second floor level there are two spacious bedrooms with fitted wardrobes, master bedroom en suite and a large family bathroom. The rear garden has been thoughtfully landscaped with a large a patio and lawn. The property has a gas central heating system and PV panels.\r\n\r\nDrynam Avenue is excellently located in Kinsealy enjoying a host of amenities in the nearby bustling villages of Malahide, Swords and Portmarnock. There is easy access to every conceivable amenity including shops, schools, parks, sporting facilities & frequent transport links to the Pavilion Shopping Centre, Airside Business & Retail Park, M50 / M1 Motorways, Dublin Airport and the Swords Express providing easy access to the city centre. Viewing comes highly recommended to appreciate this fine family home"
      },
      {
        "ContentType": "Accommodation",
        "SortOrder": 1,
        "Content": "Hall     2.68 x 2.70   Herringbone timber floor, wall panelling, light fitting, coat hanger\r\n\r\nGuest Wc    1.8 x 1.2   Tiled floor, wc, whb with tile splashback, dome light\r\n\r\nLounge / Dining Room       7.11 x 3.64    Herringbone timber floor, wall mounted radiator, double doors to rear garden, light fitting\r\n\r\nKitchen   3.0 x 2.8   Herringbone timber floor, fully fitted kitchen, oven, hob, extractor fan, fridge / freezer, built in storage press\r\n\r\nUtility Room  Plumbed for washer dryer, dragons den under stair storage, shelving\r\n\r\nStairs /Landing  Stira access to floored attic, hot press \r\nBathroom \t2.5 x 1.8  Tiled floor and partial walls, heated rail, wc, whb, large bath suite, mirror, blinds \r\n\t\t\r\nBedroom 1 \t5.1 x 3.0\tFitted wardrobes, wall panelling, light fitting, walk in wardrobe\r\n\r\nEn Suite \t1.9 x 1.8\tTiled floor& partial walls, wc, whb, standalone shower, heated towel rail\r\n\r\nBedroom 2  \t4.0 x 3.4\tDouble fitted wardrobe, light fitting \r\n\r\nRear Garden \t\tPart slab, part lawn, walled & fenced"
      },
      {
